WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.180
And and or are small words with big jobs.

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.730
And says both things are true.

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.550
Or says choose one.

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:11.030
The bread and the cheese means you get both.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:14.380
The bread or the cheese means you get one.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.400
When you see or, ask:

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.420
what is the choice?
